WEBVTT

00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:04.111
When your customer comes to pay, tap <b>Cobrar crédito</b> (collect credit)

00:00:04.229 --> 00:00:09.301
At the top are the people who owe, how much and since when

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:13.698
See each pending purchase; choose the one they are paying

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:17.788
They can <b>pay part</b> of it, or <b>pay it all off</b> at once

00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:23.235
Collect it, and MiCaja prints a receipt with their remaining balance
